      "trackName": "Ipet - Virtual pet for watch",
      "description": "Ipet – Virtual pet for watch\n\nBring a virtual pet to life — right on your Apple Watch.\n\nWith Ipet, you take care of your own digital companion, always within reach. Feed it, play together, and watch your pet grow over time. Ipet is designed as a light, fun, and intuitive experience that fits perfectly into short moments throughout your day.\n\nWhat can you do with Ipet?\n  - Take care of your own virtual pet\n  - Feed your pet and keep it happy\n  - Play quick, interactive mini activities\n  - Fully optimized for Apple Watch\n  - View and manage progress in the iPhone companion app\n\nWhether you’re waiting, taking a short break, or just want a moment of fun — Ipet is always with you.",
